 '[{"id":"s1","label":"Technique","placeholder":"MRI of the [right/left / bilateral] hip was performed on a [1.5T/3T] system including T1W, T2W fat-sat, PD fat-sat, and STIR sequences in axial, coronal, and sagittal planes. [MR arthrography with intra-articular gadolinium if performed].","required":true,"type":"text"},{"id":"s2","label":"Clinical Indication","placeholder":"Hip pain / suspected AVN / labral tear / FAI / groin pain / marrow assessment...","required":true,"type":"text"},{"id":"s3","label":"Femoral Head and AVN Assessment","placeholder":"RIGHT FEMORAL HEAD:\n  Marrow signal: [normal / T1 hypointense, T2 signal — double line sign: present/absent]\n  AVN: [absent / present — ARCO stage I/II/III/IV; crescent sign: present/absent; collapse: absent/mild/moderate/severe]\n  Articular cartilage: [normal / thinning / focal defect]\n\nLEFT FEMORAL HEAD: [as above]","required":true,"type":"text"},{"id":"s4","label":"Acetabulum and Labrum","placeholder":"ACETABULUM:\n  Morphology: [normal / dysplasia — LCE angle / protrusio / coxa profunda]\n  Acetabular cartilage: [normal / focal thinning / kissing lesion]\n\nACETABULAR LABRUM:\n  Anterior: [intact / tear — superior/anterior/posterior, paralabral cyst]\n  Posterosuperior: [intact / tear]\n  Posterior: [intact]\n  Labral morphology: [normal / degenerate / hypertrophic]","required":true,"type":"text"},{"id":"s5","label":"FAI Assessment","placeholder":"FEMOROACETABULAR IMPINGEMENT (FAI):\n  CAM morphology: [absent / present — alpha angle: [X] degrees, normal <55 degrees; location: anterosuperior; fibrocystic change at head-neck junction]\n  PINCER morphology: [absent / present — overcoverage, crossover sign]\n  Combined: [absent / present]\n  Hip offset: [normal / reduced]\n\nJOINT SPACE: [preserved / narrowed — mild/moderate/severe]","required":true,"type":"text"},{"id":"s6","label":"Periarticular Structures","placeholder":"JOINT EFFUSION: [absent / small / moderate / large — simple/complex]\nHIP FLEXORS (iliopsoas, rectus femoris): [normal / tendinopathy / tear / bursitis]\nABDUCTORS (gluteus medius, minimus): [intact / tendinopathy / partial / complete tear at greater trochanter]\nGREATER TROCHANTERIC BURSA: [no fluid / bursitis]\nSACROILIAC JOINTS: [normal bilaterally]","required":false,"type":"text"},{"id":"s7","label":"Impression","placeholder":"1. [AVN right/left femoral head — ARCO stage X / No AVN].\n2. [Labral tear — anterior/anterosuperior — paralabral cyst present/absent].\n3. [CAM/Pincer/Combined FAI — alpha angle X degrees].\n4. [Gluteal tendinopathy / tear at greater trochanter].\n5. [Joint space — preserved / reduced].","required":true,"type":"text"}]'::jsonb,
 '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),

('00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000',
